      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Per company: 1 LLM call -> revenue (USD Mn)\n   tagged Evidence-based / LLM-estimated\n2. known_total = sum(company revenue)\n3. 1 LLM call -> global coverage_fraction\n4. supply_total = known_total / coverage_fraction\n\nNo LangGraph here -- stateless map + reduce,\nno iterative refinement needed.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Per company: 1 LLM call -> revenue (USD Mn)\n   tagged Evidence-based / LLM-estimated\n2. known_total = sum(company revenue)\n3. 1 LLM call -> global coverage_fraction\n4. supply_total = known_total / coverage_fraction\n\nNo LangGraph here -- stateless map + reduce,\nno iterative refinement needed.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
